
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository in your research,
  please cite the associated software and data release.
type: software

title: >-
  Comparative Immune Genomics and Genomic
  Organization of Immune-Related Genes
  in Four Bee Species

authors:
  - family-names: Kassem
    given-names: Abdelmajid

repository-code: >-
  https://github.com/abdelmajidk/bee-immune-comparative-genomics

abstract: >-
  Research code, computational workflows, and derived
  datasets supporting comparative analyses of putative
  immune-related genes in Megachile rotundata,
  Apis mellifera, Bombus terrestris, and
  Bombus impatiens. The study includes protein-family
  classification, orthogroup analysis, genomic
  distribution, and gene-model evaluation.

keywords:
  - comparative genomics
  - insect immunity
  - Megachile rotundata
  - orthogroups
  - genomic organization
  - bioinformatics

license: NOASSERTION
